            <ArticleTitle>A technique for surgical correction of fallopian tube prolapse.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>747-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Prolapse of the fallopian tube is a rare complication of gynecologic surgery. Five cases were operated upon in the authors' hospital within the past year. A summary of these cases is given. One of the cases, which required a second operative procedure, is discussed. The surgical technique for complete excision of the prolapsed fallopian tube via the vagina is described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
